---
layout: base.njk
title: Wanted
description: Wanted transportation tokens, undocumented pieces, errors, oddities, counterfeits, and related exonumia sought for the Exonumist collection.
permalink: /wanted/index.html
---

<section class="section" id="want-list">
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span>/</span>
    <span>Wanted</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="about-split">
    <div>
      <h1>Wanted</h1>

      <p class="section-intro">
        I am actively looking for certain pieces for the collection, especially early New York
        transportation tokens, undocumented material, unusual varieties, and better examples of
        pieces already represented here.
      </p>

      {% if wantedView.wantedTokens.length %}
        <h2>Currently Seeking</h2>

        <div class="wanted-token-list">
          {% for token in wantedView.wantedTokens %}
            <a class="wanted-token-link" href="{{ token.url }}">
              <span class="wanted-token-badge">{{ token.badgeLabel }}</span>

              <strong>{{ token.id }}</strong>

              <span>{{ token.title }}</span>

              <span class="wanted-token-meta">
                {% for part in token.metaParts %}
                  {% if not loop.first %} · {% endif %}{{ part }}
                {% endfor %}
              </span>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if wantedView.hasWantList %}
        <h2 class="wanted-secondary-heading">Other Wanted Material</h2>

        <ul class="prose-width">
          {% for item in wantedView.otherWantedItems %}
            <li>
              <strong>{{ item.title }}</strong>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside want-list-cta">
      <h3>Have something interesting?</h3>

      <p>
        I am especially interested in New York transportation tokens, undocumented pieces,
        unusual varieties, and historically interesting exonumia.
      </p>

      <p>
        Unknown and error tokens interest me most.
      </p>

      <p class="want-list-cta-prompt">Have tokens or exonumia to sell or trade?</p>
      <a class="inline-icon-link" href="mailto:contact@exonumist.com">
        <span class="inline-icon-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">✉</span>
        <span>Get in touch</span>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
